  "2026-10-27T02:46:18.309Z","harness:codex","Native reproduction: executable lookup succeeds, but /bin/sh reports absent shebang interpreter with exit126 and the original bad-interpreter diagnostic on this host. The real linked regression failed as assertion_failure before this change (negative log retained privately), then passed after the fix. POSIX shells reporting named not-found/127 use the same bounded-header proof; Windows resolution remains separate. Linux execve documents ENOENT for a missing script interpreter: https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/execve.2.html. The classifier reads at most256 header bytes with nonblocking open, closes the handle, declines incomplete/ambiguous or unavailable evidence, and never reruns the user command. Real executed scripts spoofing both127 and126 diagnostics remain assertions. Focused110 tests pass, including platform controls; focused exact module coverage is100/100/100/100 (42statements,45branches,6functions,37lines), typecheck and focused lint pass."
  "2026-10-27T02:49:11.012Z","harness:codex","Review1608 negative-control clarification: candidate73846f26f2255ca4afaffb642543e2e3d3d63f44 with ONLY src/sdk/test/command-resolution.ts replaced by 9dad0a28c87beb0fbb66f9eec9f7360f9bf549dd. The recorded runnable control archives immutable source into a disposable checkout, uses sandboxed PM roots, and requires exactly the named AssertionError before intentionally returning exit1; setup/runtime failure returns3. Executed now and proved the intended failure. Current passing local_checks are separate. Existing immutable events remain preserved; no prior history was edited."
  "2026-10-27T02:49:45.963Z","harness:codex","Acceptance complete: linked execution passed all110 tests; focused exact coverage passed100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts; typecheck, focused ESLint, and docs/skills gate pass. Each of the three replay controls independently archived its immutable candidate, substituted only the named pre-fix source file, and proved exactly its intended AssertionError. The current fields identify runnable failing controls separately from current passing local_checks, while old immutable history is preserved. The dependency checkpoint finding is declined with exact timestamps in its existing inline thread: checkpoint22:07:37Z predates PR creation23:33:40Z. Hosted revised-head checks and review remain required before merge."
